{"title":"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Note\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Note</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using only the paths and the directions shown, how many different routes are there from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/2/f6200a2d5c2ab9c68b6e6ae48c7132f3c8849766.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{M}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/a/60afefdccd9cd87ba1923010049fc21a05f99136.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{N}$\" width=\"12\" height=\"11\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/b/d7b6d3b20583aeac57d4bae5e7e0367f8b123720.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(3,0),MidArrow); draw((3,0)--(6,0),MidArrow); draw(6*dir(60)--3*dir(60),MidArrow); draw(3*dir(60)--(0,0),MidArrow); draw(3*dir(60)--(3,0),MidArrow); draw(5.1961524227066318805823390245176*dir(30)--(6,0),MidArrow); draw(6*dir(60)--5.1961524227066318805823390245176*dir(30),MidArrow); draw(5.1961524227066318805823390245176*dir(30)--3*dir(60),MidArrow); draw(5.1961524227066318805823390245176*dir(30)--(3,0),MidArrow); label(&quot;M&quot;,6*dir(60),N); label(&quot;N&quot;,(6,0),SE); label(&quot;A&quot;,3*dir(60),NW); label(&quot;B&quot;,5.1961524227066318805823390245176*dir(30),NE); label(&quot;C&quot;,(3,0),S); label(&quot;D&quot;,(0,0),SW); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"225\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/9/c0904a1807339bc66742fe6716ebc810957bf718.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After one step, the possible routes are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/2/e322e33b520d7e0d83a7220fa27b20b07c856adb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/fae5dfb86091640ea71cc0c1641f77438cedf8c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>After two steps, the possible routes are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c732878343a07a95d78100531598cf49eb8f400.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/8/e5868a36dd267b31fb5add51f55b20d5f9bf71ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"106\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/d/b1d281fecbbf2efddb5b8b31ed739b5b63cb7366.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow B \\rightarrow A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"106\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/e/73e990c13c172c357c3356ef10783b76b086ee71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow B \\rightarrow C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c9e477e5451c7b6a816e8b21202fc1ef5e5526.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow B \\rightarrow N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"14\" /> (complete).\n</p><p>After three steps, the possible routes are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/4/484d336bcfca7b55eebf65965e62510f1c2e97df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow D \\rightarrow C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"150\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/4/6949e5b6fc8e4c6971abe49af4c830668a9e61cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow C \\rightarrow N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"151\" height=\"14\" /> (complete), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/c/48c3a9846dbfb7e8eff35074dd8cf732740fe814.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow B \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"150\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/0/7c006da72ec134d1e425719ca657394c795c0db2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow B \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"149\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/7/f47206d7ba1265ab12d4af9a15bbb37b5f9b9a21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow B \\rightarrow C \\rightarrow N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"152\" height=\"14\" /> (complete).\n</p><p>After four steps, the possible routes are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/c/73c32fd33bc1b9a64457b67ab76ee1cafef55793.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow D \\rightarrow C \\rightarrow N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"195\" height=\"14\" /> (complete), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/0/cb0a79f01aa925d6d23cf1f8a7ac3f1f00fb4416.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow B \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow D \\rightarrow C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"193\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/b/56b10f22c4103aa4d132388aa14370cb5ca7be87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow B \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow C \\rightarrow N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"194\" height=\"14\" /> (complete).\n</p><p>After five steps, the only possible route is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d90c465873b12fc90b0d20e35861fe6443dc095.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M \\rightarrow B \\rightarrow A \\rightarrow D \\rightarrow C \\rightarrow N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"238\" height=\"14\" /> (complete).\n</p><p>Therefore, there <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/1/f2192779fb1d8828b06ce59a7ae3f9a2ef90ca5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"53\" height=\"28\" /> paths from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> path from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, since the only edge leaving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.  \n</p><p>Since the only edge leaving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, there is only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> path from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> edges which leave <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />; one leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and the other leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />.  Therefore, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/9/349b6b8a00581fb06095c20113d8fa49f3f5cf9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 1 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" /> paths from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> edges which leave <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />; one leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, one leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and one leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.  Therefore, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/1/8a1a526c69bf7a4908fbbf32fee188d2557aaa35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 1 + 1 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" /> paths from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> edges which leave <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />; one leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and the other leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />.  Therefore, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/0/100cdc45526fbc16bfc1d5898fcebec89876c067.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 + 2 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"120\" height=\"30\" /> paths from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The following diagram shows the number of paths to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> from each starting point.   \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/b/6eb723c0351f4696a6aba6d996fce4457bc0c6aa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(3,0),MidArrow); draw((3,0)--(6,0),MidArrow); draw(6*dir(60)--3*dir(60),MidArrow); draw(3*dir(60)--(0,0),MidArrow); draw(3*dir(60)--(3,0),MidArrow); draw(5.1961524227066318805823390245176*dir(30)--(6,0),MidArrow); draw(6*dir(60)--5.1961524227066318805823390245176*dir(30),MidArrow); draw(5.1961524227066318805823390245176*dir(30)--3*dir(60),MidArrow); draw(5.1961524227066318805823390245176*dir(30)--(3,0),MidArrow); label(&quot;M&quot;,6*dir(60),N); label(&quot;N&quot;,(6,0),SE); label(&quot;A&quot;,3*dir(60),NW); label(&quot;B&quot;,5.1961524227066318805823390245176*dir(30),NE); label(&quot;C&quot;,(3,0),S); label(&quot;D&quot;,(0,0),SW); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(6,0),1.2*N+2*W,blue); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(3,.1),N,blue); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(.2,0),NE,blue); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,3*dir(60),S+2*E,blue); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,5.1961524227066318805823390245176*dir(30),S+2*W,blue); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,6*dir(60),1.5*S,blue); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"225\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Note\">Note</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Note\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This is an example of a directed acyclic graph (DAG); it has no cycles (paths that start and end at the same point).  A topological sort of this graph is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/6/f264099ec14b2f81a9e30410f62dd04d3bac5069.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M, B, A, D, C, N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME\" title=\"1986 AJHSME\">1986 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1986 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1986 AJ